  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Project Efficiency and Community Needs Assessment at the grassroots</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">In former Warrap State where CTP partner (TOCH) is implementing a peace building and access to justice project is a hot spot to conflict. CTP Governance and Peace Building Programme is planning to conduct a community needs assessment in Gogrial West county to understand the drivers, actors and the affected groups by conflict in the community and device a way on how to resolve those conflicts. Also CTP is planning to do partner project reviews to  evaluate the progress, challenges, opportunities and make decisions on which partners they should continue to work with based on the findings. 

Governance and Peace Building Programme had planned support visit and accompaniment to partners in the field. The support visit to partners is meant for project efficiency check, working together with partners and get solutions to issues affecting partners.</narrative>
  </description>
